Quds adds validation, Unicode source safety, conservative guards, bounded worker
lifecycle and provider integration. These additions do not claim parity with
unpublished Proofbird application guards.

The cased WordPiece implementation follows BERT's public tokenizer semantics;
it does not include ONNX Runtime or an ONNX execution dependency.
